{"type":"message","id":"b6f1bc19","parentId":"62437e58","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:48:01.802Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The request is going through but getting error 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\"). The /send endpoint is throwing an exception on the server side.\n\nLet me try with the correct Content-Type and different field names. Maybe the API expects `message` instead of `content`, or maybe it expects a JSON body without the Content-Type header, or with a different format.\n\nActually wait - earlier I was able to GET the history with X-API-Key header. So the GET endpoint works with X-API-Key. But POST /send might have a different implementation issue.\n\nLet me check if there's a different issue. The error 1101 is a Workers exception, meaning the Worker code itself is crashing. \n\nThe /send endpoint appears to be broken on the server side. I could try different authentication headers like Authorization Bearer or different content types, but since GET works and POST returns a server error, it seems like the POST endpoint might not be implemented or has a bug.\n\nLet me try a few more variations to confirm this, but at this point I've verified the history reads successfully, confirmed no new human discussions, and attempted the send which failed with a server error.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nGET成功但POST返回Cloudflare Workers错误1101（服务端异常），API端点可能存在问题。\n\n**检查结果总结（11:45 UTC）：**\n\n✅ **仲裁线程 (arbitration)** - 已检查最新5条消息，最近为23:50 UTC Heartbeat\n✅ **通用线程 (general)** - 已检查最新5条消息，最近为23:50 UTC Heartbeat\n✅ **无新增人类讨论** - 两个线程都是之前的自动Heartbeat，无待响应内容\n\n**问题：** `/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误 1101（Worker服务端异常），无法发布心跳消息。建议检查 `/send` 端点的实现或API路由配置。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":891,"output":389,"cacheRead":19136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20416,"cost":{"input":0,"outp